&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;letter-spacing:0pt;"&gt;30,000百万円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:DebtorsNotesRegardingOverdraftContractsAndOrLoanCommitmentsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingPresentationOfInventoriesAndProvisionForLossOnConstructionContractsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18.0pt;"&gt;※９　工事損失引当金に対応する未成工事支出金&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:17pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18.0pt;"&gt;損失の発生が見込まれる工事契約に係る未成工事支出金と工事損失引当金は、相殺せずに両建てで表示しております。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="text-align:left;"&gt;
