&lt;h3 class="smt_head2" style="padding-left:23.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;２　開示対象特別目的会社との取引金額等&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:41.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;前連結会計年度（自  &lt;span&gt;2022年４月１日&lt;/span&gt;  至  &lt;span&gt;2023年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;）&lt;/p&gt;
